  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CARITAS Makeni - Bridging Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key objective of the institutional support bridging grant is to strengthen organisation&#x2019;s management to bridge the transition gap between outgoing and incoming directorate leadership and to fit Caritas Makeni well within its strategic framework.
It is a period of stabilization and reflecting on where we are coming from, where we are; and where we are going. This requires a self-reflection approach through a learning event to capture lessons learnt and best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
